	runCmd.Flags().Bool("no-enable-hcpp", false, "Enable the use of the HCPP platform view rendering mode on the Impeller rendering backend. An explicit value takes priority over the EnableHcpp metadata in AndroidManifest.xml: build commands write it into the manifest of the artifact they produce, and \"run\", \"test\", and \"drive\" additionally apply it at launch. Without the flag, the manifest decides, and if the manifest does not set it either, the enable-hcpp feature flag does.")
